      "content": "thanks for this. it's a good start and hits the notes, but it feels a bit thin. \n\nthe senior partner pointed out that the automated score for this section is currently sitting pretty low because there aren't many binomials in there. look, i really don't want you to just dump names in a list, but the report needs to look more \"robust\" to the software. \n\ncan you expand this out a bit more? try to incorporate more of the observed species to give a more comprehensive feel to the biodiversity, while still keeping it as a coherent summary of the ecosystem health. definitely try to get that score up without it looking like a grocery list.",
      "source": "evaluator"
